WEBVTT

00:01:59.602 --> 00:02:01.406
how is it possible

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.976
to generate the sort
of complexity I've described,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.788
the sort of complexity
represented by you and me

00:02:07.812 --> 00:02:09.501
and the convention center?

00:02:10.859 --> 00:02:12.812
Well, the answer seems to be,

00:02:12.836 --> 00:02:15.976
the universe can create complexity,

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.555
but with great difficulty.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:19.707
In pockets,

00:02:19.731 --> 00:02:22.048
there appear
what my colleague, Fred Spier,

00:02:22.072 --> 00:02:24.214
calls "Goldilocks conditions" --

00:02:24.238 --> 00:02:26.289
not too hot, not too cold,

00:02:26.313 --> 00:02:28.976
just right for the creation of complexity.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.267
And slightly more complex things appear.